INTRO=("<b>Thank you for taking part.</b> COSMIC is bringing together cognitive test data from ageing studies around the world, "
"using the Harmonized Cognitive Assessment Protocol (HCAP) as the reference. Before any statistics, we need expert judgement on two things: "
"what each test measures, and which tests are similar enough across studies to act as links between them.<br><br>"
"You will see <b>18 tests, one per page</b>. Each page starts with a <b>reference panel</b> describing the test as it was given in one study. "
"Please judge that version, not the test in general. Existing classifications are deliberately not shown.<br><br>"
"<b>For each test we ask:</b> which cognitive domain it mainly measures; any other domains; how confident you are; what else might affect scores; "
"and, where there is a comparison item, whether the two could be linked.<br><br>"
"<b>Your answers are confidential.</b> They are stored under a code, not your name, and only the moderator can match codes to people. "
"Please answer on your own and do not discuss your answers with other panel members. In Round 2 you will see the group's anonymised answers next to your own.<br><br>"
"<i>Cannot judge</i> is a valid answer and tells us the description needs more detail. This takes about 45 to 60 minutes, and you can save and return.")
